    <p class="mh">Guides</p><a class="mt" href="/nclex-study-guides"><b>Free study guides</b><small>Printable PDFs</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-at-home"><b>NCLEX at home</b><small>What's coming</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-prep-comparison"><b>Compare NCLEX prep</b><small>What each one includes</small></a><a class="mt" href="/about"><b>About Vexcura</b><small>Who built it</small></a>
    <p class="mh">Account</p><a class="mt" href="/#signup"><b>Join with a school code</b><small>Or request access</small></a><a class="mt" href="/#signin"><b>Sign in</b><small>Already have one</small></a>
   </div></details></nav></div></header><script>(function(){var d=document.querySelector(".mnav");if(!d)return;document.addEventListener("click",function(e){if(d.open&&!d.contains(e.target))d.open=false});document.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Escape"&&d.open){d.open=false;d.querySelector("summary").focus()}})})();</script><main><nav class="crumb w" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › <span>For nursing schools</span></nav><section class="hero w hv"><div><h1>NCLEX Prep and an Academic EHR, Licensed to Your Nursing School</h1><p class="lead">One platform for NCLEX-RN readiness, Epic-style charting practice and clinical instruction. The school or facility pays; students and instructors are always free.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="#pilot">Request a demo or pilot</a><a class="btn alt" href="#pricing">See pricing</a></div></div><figure class="shot duo"><div class="duo-s"><div class="dv dv-b"><div class="dv-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span><svg viewBox="0 0 12 14" width="9" height="11" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6V4.2a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="1.5" y="6" width="9" height="7" rx="1.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>nclexsim.com</span></div><div class="dv-v"><img src="/img/d-mychart-1000.webp" srcset="/img/d-mychart-1600.webp 1600w, /img/d-mychart-1000.webp 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 72px), 560px" width="1000" height="625" alt="Vexcura My Chart for a demo nursing student: questions seen, pass likelihood, streak, missed-question cards, question of the day and a study advisory" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div></div><div class="dv dv-p dv-po" style="--sb:#103a4f"><div class="dv-s"><div class="dv-sb lt" aria-hidden="true"><time class="vx-now" data-f="sb"></time><span class="dv-isl"></span><span class="dv-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 12" width="17" height="11"><rect x="0" y="8" width="3" height="4" rx=".8"/><rect x="5" y="5.5" width="3" height="6.5" rx=".8"/><rect x="10" y="3" width="3" height="9" rx=".8"/><rect x="15" y="0" width="3" height="12" rx=".8"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 16 12" width="15" height="11"><path d="M8 11.6 5.6 9.2a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 4.8 0z"/><path d="M3.4 7A6.5 6.5 0 0 1 12.6 7l-1.3 1.3a4.7 4.7 0 0 0-6.6 0z"/><path d="M1.1 4.7a9.7 9.7 0 0 1 13.8 0l-1.3 1.3a7.9 7.9 0 0 0-11.2 0z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 27 13" width="25" height="12"><rect x=".6" y=".6" width="22.8" height="11.8" rx="3.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".4" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="2.4" y="2.4" width="17.6" height="8.2" rx="2"/><path d="M25 4.4v4.2c.9-.3 1.4-1.1 1.4-2.1s-.5-1.8-1.4-2.1z" fill-opacity=".45"/></svg></span></div><div class="dv-v"><img src="/img/p-day-780.webp" srcset="/img/p-day-400.webp 400w, /img/p-day-780.webp 780w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) 30vw, 160px" width="780" height="1600" alt="Clinical attendance on a phone in the instructor workspace, with demo students" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div></div></div><figcaption>A student's My Chart on a laptop, and an instructor taking clinical attendance on a phone. Demo data.</figcaption></figure></section><div class="w"><h2>What your program gets</h2><div class="feat"><div><b>NCLEX-RN readiness</b>1,220 cited practice questions with rationales, adaptive practice exams that stop by the NCLEX rules, NGN item types and 8 unfolding case studies, drills, and missed-question cards.</div><div><b>An Epic-style academic EHR</b>My Chart, a MAR, flowsheets, orders, LDAs, care plans and handoff on practice patients, with a Brain and worklist sidebar students recognize from hospital systems.</div><div><b>The instructor workspace</b>My students, clinical days with attendance, assign work, curriculum and content, on a phone or a laptop.</div><div><b>Badge sign-in</b>Students tap in for clinical with any USB RFID or barcode reader that types like a keyboard. An optional PIN adds a second check.</div><div><b>Your curriculum, in the same place</b>Upload lectures, handouts and links. Students see them next to Vexcura's material, and required items show up on their documentation list.</div><div><b>Fits your systems</b>LTI 1.3 for Canvas, Blackboard, D2L Brightspace and Moodle, Google and Microsoft sign-in, roster upload and personal invite links.</div></div><div class="split"><div class="st"><h2>The full NCLEX-RN practice exam</h2><p>Students sit a full adaptive exam: 85 to 150 items on a five-hour clock, NGN case studies, and the same stopping rules as the NCLEX. Results show a pass-likelihood estimate and every client needs category, so faculty and students see where to focus before the real exam.</p><p><a href="/free-nclex-practice-exam">The full practice exam</a></p></div><figure class="shot"><div class="dv dv-b"><div class="dv-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span><svg viewBox="0 0 12 14" width="9" height="11" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6V4.2a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="1.5" y="6" width="9" height="7" rx="1.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>nclexsim.com</span></div><div class="dv-v"><img src="/img/exam-results-1000.webp" srcset="/img/exam-results-1600.webp 1600w, /img/exam-results-1000.webp 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 32px), 720px" width="1000" height="625" alt="Full practice exam results for a demo student: a 74% pass-likelihood estimate, labeled as an estimate, with ability by item" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div><figcaption>End-of-exam results for a demo student. The pass likelihood is an estimate, not a prediction.</figcaption></figure></div>
       <div class="split rev"><div class="st"><h2>See who needs help, before clinical</h2><p>Instructors open to today's clinical, the students in their groups, and who has practiced this week. Attendance is one tap per student, or students sign themselves in from My Chart or with a badge.</p><p><a href="/clinical-instructor-tools">Clinical instructor tools</a></p></div><figure class="shot"><div class="dv dv-b"><div class="dv-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span><svg viewBox="0 0 12 14" width="9" height="11" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6V4.2a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="1.5" y="6" width="9" height="7" rx="1.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>nclexsim.com</span></div><div class="dv-v"><img src="/img/d-instructor-1000.webp" srcset="/img/d-instructor-1600.webp 1600w, /img/d-instructor-1000.webp 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 32px), 720px" width="1000" height="625" alt="Clinical instructor home: take attendance, assign work, see my students and upcoming clinical days, with demo students" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div></figure></div>
       <h2 id="pricing">Pricing: every plan includes everything</h2>
       <p>Vexcura is licensed to nursing schools and healthcare facilities. <b>Students and instructors never pay.</b> The school or facility pays for the license, and there are no student plans, tiers or add-ons. Plans differ only in how many students they cover.</p>
       <div class="tw"><table class="price"><thead><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Students</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Per student</b></td><td>Any size; the program chooses the number of seats</td><td><b>$99 per student seat</b> <small>per year</small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Site 100</b></td><td>Up to 100 students</td><td><b>$7,500</b> <small>per year</small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Site 250</b></td><td>101 to 250 students</td><td><b>$15,000</b> <small>per year</small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Site 500</b></td><td>251 to 500 students</td><td><b>$25,000</b> <small>per year</small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Custom</b></td><td>More than 500 students, several campuses, or major customizations</td><td><b>Custom quote</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
       <p class="soon"><b>Coming soon:</b> board-ready reporting, included in every plan.</p>
       <h3>Every plan includes</h3><ul class="incl"><li>NCLEX-RN practice questions and adaptive practice exams, with rationales and sources</li><li>Next Generation NCLEX item types and unfolding case studies</li><li>Topic drills, bedside simulation and the ACLS megacode simulator</li><li>Missed-question cards, question of the day with streaks, and results by category</li><li>The academic EHR: My Chart, MAR, flowsheets, orders, LDAs, care plans and handoff</li><li>The Brain and worklist sidebar, with assigned work and required documentation</li><li>Live clinical groups with patients students choose to share</li><li>The instructor workspace: my students, clinical days with attendance, assign work, curriculum and content</li><li>Program admin: seats, codes, rosters and a data export</li><li>Badge sign-in with any USB RFID or barcode reader, with an optional PIN</li><li>Your own curriculum uploads, shown next to Vexcura content</li><li>Google and Microsoft sign-in, and LTI 1.3 for your LMS</li><li>Free printable study guides and PDFs</li><li>Setup help from Tyler Savage, RN</li></ul>
       <div class="paybox"><div><b>Billing by check</b>Licenses are invoiced per year and paid by check only, payable to Vexcura, Attn: Tyler J. Savage, 27 General Cleburne St., Ringgold, GA 30736.</div><div><b>One person to call</b>Tyler Savage, RN is your representative from the first demo to renewal, and handles major customizations personally. Call <a href="tel:+17626772802">762-677-2802</a>.</div><div><b>Faculty never use a seat</b>Instructor and program admin accounts are free and never use a student seat. A seat is one student for the license term.</div></div>
       <h2>Built for how programs buy</h2><ul><li><b>Contract packet:</b> an order form, license agreement, student data privacy agreement and pilot agreement.</li><li><b>FERPA and data handling:</b> a written statement of what's collected, who can see it and how it's deleted. The practice EHR is designed to keep real patient information out.</li><li><b>Security questionnaire:</b> draft answers in the HECVAT style for your IT review.</li><li><b>Accessibility:</b> a draft conformance report in the VPAT format. Automated axe-core testing finds no violations on the main screens; an independent manual review hasn't been completed yet.</li><li><b>Your data, your copy:</b> program admins can export their program's data as JSON or CSV at any time. Live system status is public at <a href="/status">nclexsim.com/status</a>.</li></ul>
       <h2>Built by a nurse, for nursing faculty</h2><p>Vexcura was founded by <a href="/about#founder">Tyler Savage, RN, CRS, LNC</a>, a registered nurse with more than a decade in medical-surgical, step-down, long-term acute care, and rehabilitation nursing. He has worked as a charge nurse, house supervisor, preceptor, and unit safety officer, served on code and rapid response teams, and charted in Epic, Cerner, MEDITECH, and ProTouch. The charting, drills, and clinical tools come from that bedside experience. He is every program's representative and handles major customizations himself.</p>
       <section class="pform" id="pilot"><h2>Request a pilot or a pricing sheet</h2><p>Tell us about your program. Tyler Savage, RN, Vexcura's founder, will contact you to set up a short demo and a pilot for one cohort. Prefer the phone? Call <a href="tel:+17626772802">762-677-2802</a>.</p>
   <form id="pinq" novalidate><div class="pg">
    <label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="80"></label>
    <label>Work email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"></label>
    <label>Your role<select name="role" required><option value="">Choose one</option><option>Dean or program director</option><option>Faculty</option><option>Clinical instructor</option><option>Simulation or skills lab coordinator</option><option>IT or LMS administrator</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
    <label>School or program<input name="school" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="120"></label>
    <label>State<input name="state" autocomplete="address-level1" maxlength="40"></label>
    <label>Program type<select name="ptype"><option value="">Choose one</option><option>ADN</option><option>BSN</option><option>Accelerated BSN</option><option>LPN to RN</option><option>Practical nursing (LPN)</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
    <label>Students per cohort<select name="size"><option value="">Choose one</option><option>Under 25</option><option>25 to 50</option><option>51 to 100</option><option>101 to 250</option><option>More than 250</option></select></label>
    <label>Your LMS<select name="lms"><option value="">Choose one</option><option>Canvas</option><option>Blackboard</option><option>D2L Brightspace</option><option>Moodle</option><option>Other or none</option></select></label></div>
    <fieldset><legend>Most interested in</legend><label class="ck"><input type="checkbox" name="int" value="NCLEX readiness">NCLEX readiness</label><label class="ck"><input type="checkbox" name="int" value="Academic EHR">Academic EHR charting</label><label class="ck"><input type="checkbox" name="int" value="Clinical paperwork">Clinical prep and evaluations</label><label class="ck"><input type="checkbox" name="int" value="Simulation drills">Simulation drills</label><label class="ck"><input type="checkbox" name="int" value="LMS grade sync">LMS grade sync</label></fieldset>
    <label class="full">Anything else?<textarea name="note" rows="3" maxlength="300"></textarea></label>
    <label class="ck full"><input type="checkbox" name="agree" required>I agree to the <a href="/#terms">Terms of Use</a> and <a href="/#privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</label>
    <p class="pmsg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="btn" type="submit">Send request</button></form></section>
  <script>(function(){var f=document.getElementById("pinq");if(!f)return;var m=f.querySelector(".pmsg");f.addEventListener("submit",function(e){e.preventDefault();var v=function(n){return (f.elements[n].value||"").trim()};
   if(!v("name")||!v("email")||!v("role")||!v("school")){m.textContent="Please fill in your name, work email, role and school.";m.className="pmsg no";return}if(!f.elements.agree.checked){m.textContent="Please accept the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.";m.className="pmsg no";return}
   var ints=[].slice.call(f.querySelectorAll("[name=int]:checked")).map(function(x){return x.value}).join(", ");
   var note=("[Program inquiry] "+v("role")+(v("ptype")?" · "+v("ptype"):"")+(v("size")?" · cohort "+v("size"):"")+(v("lms")?" · LMS "+v("lms"):"")+(ints?" · wants "+ints:"")+(v("note")?" · "+v("note"):"")).slice(0,500);
   var b=f.querySelector("button");b.disabled=true;m.textContent="Sending…";m.className="pmsg";
   fetch("/api/access/request",{method:"POST",headers:{"Content-Type":"application/json","X-NCLEX":"1"},credentials:"same-origin",body:JSON.stringify({name:v("name"),email:v("email"),heard:"program",price:"",note:note,agree:true,profile:{program:"Program inquiry",school:v("school"),state:v("state")}})})
   .then(function(r){return r.json().catch(function(){return {}}).then(function(j){if(r.ok){f.innerHTML="<p class=\"pmsg ok\"><b>Thank you.</b> Your request is in, and we'll be in touch soon.</p>";return}m.textContent=(j&&j.error)||"That didn't go through. Please call 762-677-2802.";m.className="pmsg no";b.disabled=false})})
   .catch(function(){m.textContent="You appear to be offline. Please try again or call 762-677-2802.";m.className="pmsg no";b.disabled=false})})})();</script>
       <h2>Questions programs ask</h2><details class="faq"><summary>How is Vexcura licensed?</summary><p>The school or facility licenses Vexcura; students, instructors and program admins never pay. Choose per student ($99 per student seat, per year, with the number of seats your program picks) or a site license: Site 100 (up to 100 students, $7,500), Site 250 (101 to 250 students, $15,000), Site 500 (251 to 500 students, $25,000). Custom plans cover more than 500 students, several campuses, or major customizations. Every plan includes every feature.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Do students or instructors pay anything?</summary><p>No. Students, instructors and program admins are always free. The school or facility licenses Vexcura.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Are some features only in higher plans?</summary><p>No. Every plan includes everything: NCLEX practice, the academic EHR, the instructor workspace, badge sign-in, curriculum uploads, SSO and LTI. Plans differ only by how many students they cover.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>How do we pay?</summary><p>By check only, payable to Vexcura, Attn: Tyler J. Savage, 27 General Cleburne St., Ringgold, GA 30736. Licenses are invoiced per year.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Can we try it before we buy?</summary><p>Yes. A free one-semester pilot covers one clinical group or cohort, with no obligation to buy. Programs that subscribe after a pilot can qualify for founding-program pricing on their first paid year.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Who do we work with?</summary><p>Tyler Savage, RN, Vexcura's founder, is the representative for every program and handles major customizations personally. Call 762-677-2802.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Does Vexcura work with our LMS and sign-in?</summary><p>Vexcura connects to Canvas, Blackboard, D2L Brightspace and Moodle using the LTI 1.3 standard. Instructors add Vexcura case assignments to a course, students open them from the course, and released grades can be sent to the gradebook. Students and faculty can also sign in with their school Google or Microsoft account.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>How does Vexcura handle student data?</summary><p>Student records are handled under FERPA as a school official with a legitimate educational interest, under a signed data privacy agreement. The practice EHR is built so no real patient information is entered: no names, dates or record numbers. Program admins can download their program's data at any time.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Is Vexcura accessible?</summary><p>Vexcura is built to WCAG 2.1 AA. Automated testing with axe-core finds no violations on the main screens, and a draft accessibility conformance report in the VPAT format is available on request. An independent manual review has not been completed yet.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Is Vexcura affiliated with NCSBN or Epic?</summary><p>No. Vexcura is independent and isn't endorsed by NCSBN or any EHR vendor. NCLEX is a registered trademark of NCSBN. Epic is a trademark of Epic Systems Corporation; &quot;Epic-style&quot; only describes the familiar hospital charting layout of Vexcura's practice EHR.</p></details>
       <h2>More for nursing programs</h2><ul class="rel"><li><a href="/clinical-instructor-tools">Clinical instructor tools</a></li><li><a href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students">Academic EHR for nursing students</a></li><li><a href="/nursing-simulation-scenarios">Deteriorating-patient simulation drills</a></li><li><a href="/nursing-lms-integration">Canvas, Blackboard, D2L and Moodle integration</a></li></ul></div><section class="band"><div class="w"><h2>Try Vexcura with one cohort for a semester, free</h2><p>Pick one clinical group or course. Faculty accounts are always free. At the end of the semester you decide whether to license it for your program; there's no obligation to buy, and every plan includes everything.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="/for-nursing-schools#pilot">Request a pilot</a><a class="btn alt" href="/for-nursing-schools">How licensing works</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="foot"><div class="w"><div class="cols">
   <div><p class="fh">Vexcura</p><p>NCLEX-RN prep and an Epic-style academic EHR, licensed to nursing schools and facilities. Free for students and instructors. Built by a registered nurse.</p></div>
